  ('privacy', 'Privacy policy', 'Privacy policy', 'What we collect, why, and your California privacy rights.',
   '{"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "DRAFT for review by a California lawyer before publishing. Replace every [bracketed] item."}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Effective date: [date]. This policy explains what Smart Cookie (\"we\") collects when you use our website and app to order meals for your children, why, who we share it with, and the choices and rights you have, including under the California Consumer Privacy Act (CCPA/CPRA) and the California Online Privacy Protection Act (CalOPPA)."}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Who this service is for"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Smart Cookie is for parents, guardians and schools. Children never have accounts and we don''t knowingly collect information directly from children under 13. A parent or school enters a child''s details on the child''s behalf."}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "What we collect"}]}, {"type": "bulletList", "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Account details: your name, email address, phone number (optional) and sign-in method."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Household details: delivery addresses and delivery notes."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Children''s details, kept to the minimum we need to feed them safely: first name, last initial, optional grade or classroom, allergies, dietary preferences and notes. We never ask for a child''s birthdate, photo or full surname."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Orders and plans: what you ordered, for which child, delivery dates, amounts, refunds, and the automatic-renewal terms you agreed to."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Payments: handled by Stripe. We never see or store your full card or bank details; we keep Stripe''s customer and payment references."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Schools: the organization''s details, classrooms, headcounts and billing contacts."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Technical data: security logs (sign-in events, IP address and browser type, kept to protect accounts) and error reports with personal details removed. We don''t use advertising trackers or sell your data."}]}]}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Allergy and dietary information"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "We treat allergy and dietary information as sensitive. It is used only to keep your child safe: to block meals that clash, to label meals and to prepare them. It is visible only to your household, to the school when you link your child to a classroom, and to our kitchen staff for preparing orders."}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "How we use information"}]}, {"type": "bulletList", "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "To take, prepare, label and deliver orders, and to bill for them."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "To run subscriptions and send the emails your account needs (confirmations, receipts, plan and security notices)."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "To send optional emails (new menus, order reminders) that you can turn off at any time from Email preferences or the unsubscribe link."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "To keep the service secure, prevent fraud and meet legal obligations."}]}]}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Who we share it with"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "We share information only with service providers that run the service for us, under contracts that limit their use of it: [Supabase (database and sign-in), Stripe (payments), Resend (email), Vercel (hosting), Sentry (error reports), Cloudflare (bot protection), Upstash (rate limiting)]. We share a child''s first name, last initial, classroom and allergies with their school only when you link the child to that school. We do not sell or share personal information for cross-context behavioral advertising."}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "How long we keep it"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "We keep your information while your account is open. When you delete your account, your sign-in is removed immediately and your children''s records are archived; they, their allergies and your addresses are deleted [24] months later. Order and payment records are kept as long as tax and accounting law requires."}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Your choices and California rights"}]}, {"type": "bulletList", "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Know and access: download a copy of your data any time from Account → Privacy → Download my data."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Correct: edit your details, children and addresses in your account."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Delete: delete your account from Account → Privacy (cancel any active plan first)."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Opt out of optional emails from Email preferences."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Non-discrimination: using these rights never affects your price or service."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "You may use an authorized agent; we''ll verify the request. Contact [email] with any request."}]}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Do Not Track: our site doesn''t track you across other sites, so we treat every visit the same whether or not your browser sends a Do Not Track signal. California''s \"Shine the Light\" law: we don''t share personal information with third parties for their direct marketing."}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Security"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "We protect accounts with encrypted connections, strict access controls (staff need two-step sign-in), rate limits and audit logs. No system is perfectly secure; tell us right away at [email] if you think your account was misused."}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Changes and contact"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "We''ll post changes here with a new effective date and email you about important ones. Questions: [business legal name], [mailing address], [email], [phone]."}]}]}', null, false, null),
  ('terms', 'Terms of service', 'Terms of service', 'The terms for ordering from Smart Cookie.',
   '{"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "DRAFT for review by a California lawyer before publishing. Replace every [bracketed] item."}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Effective date: [date]. These terms are an agreement between you and [business legal name] (\"Smart Cookie\") for ordering meals through this website and app."}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Accounts"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "You must be an adult parent, guardian or school representative. Keep your sign-in details secure; you''re responsible for orders placed from your account."}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Ordering, cutoffs and delivery"}]}, {"type": "bulletList", "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Each week''s menu has an ordering cutoff shown on the menu. You can change or cancel an order until the cutoff; after it, the order is final because we buy ingredients and cook to order."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Delivery days, windows and fees depend on your delivery zone and are shown before you pay. School orders are dropped at the school as agreed with the school."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Prices are shown in US dollars at checkout and charged when you place an order (or as part of your plan)."}]}]}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Allergies"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "You''re responsible for keeping each child''s allergies and dietary needs accurate and up to date. We label the top 9 allergens and any others we list, block meals that clash with the allergies you enter, and ask you to confirm allergies at checkout. Our kitchen handles common allergens, so we can''t promise any meal is free of an allergen or of cross-contact. See our Allergy policy."}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Plans and automatic renewal"}]}, {"type": "bulletList", "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Plans renew automatically at the price and frequency shown next to the Start button until you cancel. Before you start a plan we show the renewal terms, any minimum term or trial, and how to cancel, and we ask for your consent; we email you a copy."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "You can cancel online at any time on your Plan page; cancellation stops the next renewal and meals already paid for are still delivered. You can also cancel by emailing [email]."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "We''ll tell you before any price change takes effect, and you can cancel before it does."}]}]}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Refunds"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Our Refund & cancellation policy explains skips, credits and refunds. Nothing in these terms limits rights you have under California law."}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Schools"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Schools that order through the school portal also agree to the order and payment terms accepted when the school was approved, including monthly invoicing and payment due dates."}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Acceptable use"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Don''t misuse the service: no attempts to access other people''s accounts or data, interfere with the site, or resell meals."}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Liability"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "[Lawyer to draft: warranty disclaimer and limitation of liability appropriate for a California food business, without limiting liability that can''t be limited by law.]"}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Changes, governing law and contact"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "We may update these terms; we''ll post the new version here and email you about important changes. California law governs these terms. Contact: [business legal name], [mailing address], [email]."}]}]}', null, false, null)
